name=Cookie - Server Patches
id=CookieServerPatch
description=Small fixes for the CookieCheetah server: Daily Challenge pins found by its nearby scan only (no scan of every loaded square), stock screen shader kept, Lifestyle and More Traits error guards, Building Clipboard leftovers (staff check, room cleanup, erosion sent once), PhunMart hides items of removed mods, Guns of Marz Picatinny Rail goes Up, Legendary Tactical Weapons need a seal to craft, Mythical katana/axe can break and be repaired, admin vehicle skin switch, temporary light switch scan (log only), The Only Cure+ Cyber arm Strength bonus given by the server and a SyncXp guard (no more "PlayerXp: no capability" kicks), Simple Silencers no longer replaces the Gunworks weapon-upgrade action (Guns of Marz muzzles and rails attach as Gunworks intends; Simple Silencers suppressors keep their screwdriver rule), Project A-Life Thai translation NPC lines no longer show as garbled text in multiplayer. FTZ Carts & Trolleys carts are donation only: carts the mod put in the world are removed when their area loads (what was inside stays on the ground), a cart in a player's hands is let go first, and no new ones are placed; carts handed out by Cookie Express are kept. The five maps added mid-season (Frogtown, Raccoon City, Raven Creek, Constown, AnruisiTown) get town zones over their buildings at server start, so their loot respawns like town loot. Working vehicles can be dismantled for scrap like a car wreck (welding mask + propane torch, Mechanics 6 and Electrical 3, 20% more salvage than a wreck); vehicles claimed with Another Vehicle Claim System, with someone inside or with items left inside cannot be. Six items of Raccoon City and AnruisiTown (Resident Evil backpack and suspenders, Biochemical Vaccines, dabaojian sword, Military Storage Backpack, Wood Chainsaw) and the 26 bags of Tomb's Wardrobe - Alternative (backpacks, satchels, duffels, chest rigs, fanny packs; its clothes stay) are donation only: they are taken out of every loot list, out of newly filled loot, and off AnruisiTown's soldier zombies and Tomb's goth/rocker zombies. Copies that were already found are removed too (carried, worn or held by a player, and on the floor, in furniture or on bodies next to a player; a removed bag's contents stay). Only the ones handed out by Cookie Express are kept. Nyx Strider: the cracked-glass check looks through the loaded vehicles instead of reading 3,721 squares around each player every half second (glass looks the same). The Removed Mod Tiles part keeps the tiles and build-entity names of mods taken off the server (Building Clipboard, Blackout Predators Extended, Ammo Maker, Kentucky Cannabis, Monorails) so the world still loads and built objects keep their picture. Admin build plan (multiplayer): staff who may use Build Cheat right-click the ground -> Build plan (admin), place pieces from the build menu (vanilla or Neat Building) into a plan without any build action or waiting, then Build all: the server builds the whole plan with the game's own build code and no materials, a few milliseconds per server tick so play goes on (Stop button while it builds), lower levels first; pieces it cannot build stay in the plan; other players near the plan are counted and the admin is asked first.
